r): fix line length and whitespace linting errors", "created_at": "2026-03-23T23:46:07Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d1df6f3dc7009489be3b3bfb2b1742b15e132c88", "message": "refactor(miniflux-curator): process oldest articles first to clear backlog", "created_at": "2026-03-23T23:44:05Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b24a7f5efafe6e112091b2c1673874da0c52f863", "message": "feat(miniflux-curator): track last processed entry ID to avoid re-scoring", "created_at": "2026-03-23T23:42:39Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "906fcd248749fad9836bfea7459897030624874a", "message": "use env vars", "created_at": "2026-03-23T21:24:34Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e1724c1369bd4fa4b5b4d42deb11890752713ad", "message": "use env vars", "created_at": "2026-03-23T21:22:31Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9921fde152c269dcd58935f3557fae116f997ac7", "message": "feat(miniflux-curator): process newest articles first to prioritize fresh content", "created_at": "2026-03-23T15:29:10Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8c91405b4e0cadb9d1c5e6efeb7194617057bae3", "message": "refactor(miniflux-curator): batch embedding requests for 55x efficiency gain\n\nExtract Python script to standalone file and optimize embedding strategy:\n- curator.py: New standalone file with batched embedding API calls\n- script.nix: Use writers.writePython3Bin, remove pkgs.curl, add BATCH_SIZE\n- default.nix: Replace maxWorkers option with batchSize (default: 64)\n- content.nix: Update service config to use batchSize=64\n\nChanges embedding from 550 individual HTTP requests to ~10 batched requests:\n- Starred (150): 150 \u2192 3 requests\n- Unread (400): 400 \u2192 7 requests\n\nThe OpenAI-compatible API supports batching via input array. Strix Halo\ncan easily handle 64 texts per batch with its 8192 batch size and 6\nparallel slots configuration.\n\nupdate", "created_at": "2026-03-23T15:22:21Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1f6ed5871ec94323d3219da26106ee42141cb201", "message": "fix old host", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:44:54Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c54d7fdc36cccc976ce2b461f6d642dc043e152e", "message": "implement miniflux curator", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:42:24Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "78f39308131d6b158a557eb1a22087608c2e2442", "message": "feat(llama-swap): add --parallel 6 to embedding model\n\nEnable concurrent embedding requests to match curator's 6 workers.\nThis allows the embedding server to handle multiple requests in parallel.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:31:23Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "391af4a5340bd726b206abf27de4cacaf9214a5a", "message": "feat(miniflux-curator): add parallel processing for embeddings\n\nAdd concurrent.futures.ThreadPoolExecutor to parallelize embedding\nrequests for both starred articles and unread entry scoring.\n\n- Process starred embeddings with 4 parallel workers (configurable)\n- Score unread entries with parallel workers for much faster processing\n- Add max_workers config option (default: 4, set to 6 on server)\n- Graceful error handling - failed entries get neutral score (5.0)\n- Updated module options with better descriptions\n\nThis should significantly reduce processing time for 400 entries.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:27:47Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b2b0664f53507cf1eecec59c220a87abd302afb8", "message": "fix(llama-swap, miniflux-curator): enable embeddings and fix API compatibility\n\nllama-swap:\n- Add --embeddings flag to qwen3-embedding-8b model configuration\n- Required to enable the /v1/embeddings endpoint on llama-server\n\nminiflux-curator:\n- Switch from Ollama API (/api/embed) to OpenAI-compatible API (/v1/embeddings)\n- Update to llama-cpp response format (data[0].embedding instead of embeddings[0])\n- Change config key from 'ollama' to 'embedding' with 'host' and 'model' fields\n- Default model changed from nomic-embed-text to qwen3-embedding-8b", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:06:45Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9d30c24de32042f6df9c71c1442af586dea3b5ad", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): update to Ollama /api/embed endpoint\n\nThe old /api/embeddings endpoint is deprecated and returns 404.\nUpdated to use the new /api/embed endpoint with 'input' parameter\nand response format (embeddings[0] instead of embedding).", "created_at": "2026-03-23T02:01:16Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8008956d006b87b45e46032f8ea0c7556557084c", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): use correct API filter for starred entries\n\nThe miniflux Python library doesn't accept status='starred' as a filter.\nStarred entries should use starred=True parameter instead.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:59:54Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b0d150f466e5fe7b7b171bfaceaa1144b56e3f3f", "message": "fix escaping", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:57:58Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ac896d96cf2691257b77aa55699089e6aa931747", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): use unstable Python env for miniflux package\n\nSwitch to unstablePkgs.python3.withPackages and use ps.miniflux to ensure the package is available and compatible with the Python interpreter.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:54:22Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ff1514847c70c919f16913f3ed8b9ebf84ca1ec2", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): escape quotes in Nix string\n\nUse ''' to escape empty string quotes inside the Nix heredoc so Python sees correct syntax.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:50:31Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "db7e14cefc6b989d2c4236316a77854f2a26f869", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): fix Python syntax error in script\n\nChange from 4 single quotes (which creates an unterminated triple-quoted string) to 2 single quotes for empty string default.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:49:23Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "affaf39f8fe67b87998bf31ef8bda062604de1da", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): set secret owner/group for API key access\n\nAllow miniflux-curator user to read the miniflux API key secret by setting owner and group permissions.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:48:10Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "457805a1b76bcf636c6fd641c2463de37e6ee79c", "message": "fix(miniflux-curator): use systemd calendar format for schedule\n\nChange from cron syntax '0 */4 * * *' to systemd format '*-*-* 00,04,08,12,16,20:00' to fix timer error.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:46:36Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6de5d68ad85789175c4fa753eb20aab9946f7d11", "message": "fix escaping", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:43:42Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f857d247b0ffa53667a7d2050d228b86d62bf68", "message": "update keys", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:39:38Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1df94660f25f84d165e768d4b26daa72f3575f0c", "message": "implement article curation", "created_at": "2026-03-23T01:21:11Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f9344a1f0d2c2232ca2502f9a186b50919511001", "message": "increase timeout", "created_at": "2026-03-22T22:37:54Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9dd18c8c1a762d3c238d0d7a8b4abdee2dcc7487", "message": "pull back batch sizes", "created_at": "2026-03-22T21:53:24Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8a4085344e0988a20306e617dfe88e98292e6e54", "message": "follow context limits for models", "created_at": "2026-03-22T21:48:52Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "635ef37b986542825217b7097d1ddc283c803fc9", "message": "increase max asset size", "created_at": "2026-03-22T20:19:39Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "77d433a5013b886f1543178c70ada6b356c63804", "message": "feat(homepage): add Karakeep bookmark manager to dashboard", "created_at": "2026-03-22T19:54:37Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0dc2a870253be815826150fe21194b77064866a5", "message": "fix(content): use correct INTEGRATION_ALLOW_PRIVATE_NETWORKS=1 for miniflux", "created_at": "2026-03-22T19:49:26Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c903e24f293ba38c42a9022bc810c2553bb35017", "message": "fix(content): allow miniflux to save to karakeep on private network", "created_at": "2026-03-22T19:47:31Z", "repo": "nix-config", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {